Description: Bun JavaScript runtime for rootless iOS.
 Built from upstream Bun commit @BUN_COMMIT@ for iPhoneOS arm64/A10.
 The command wrapper disables JavaScriptCore Gigacage on iOS so it can run
 inside the iPad process address-space policy.
